        "text": "R6 wood-glidewalk  PURPOSE: wings become joy, and the lamp joins the glide"
      },
      { "x": 40, "y": 360, "text": "E0 (0-576, y 512): in from wood-glade" },
      { "x": 620, "y": 640, "text": "GAP 1 (safe): gap 800, drop 448. walk-off glide 1045, jump-glide 1319" },
      {
        "x": 330,
        "y": 200,
        "text": "a root roof over E0's lip: a jump bumps it; walk off and glide (the walk-off, taught)"
      },
      { "x": 620, "y": 1360, "text": "safe floor; root rungs (one-ways) back up to E0" },
      { "x": 1500, "y": 900, "text": "T2  W4 wick-landing (1800, 640): glide's first lamp, a jump-cut" },
      {
        "x": 2050,
        "y": 640,
        "text": "GAP 2: caught at W5, thrown, wings open: on to T3. Or a walk-off glide under the pull"
      },
      { "x": 2200, "y": 1880, "text": "thorns: 1 light and back to T2" },
      { "x": 3060, "y": 1380, "text": "T3, P-t3 moon patch" },
      {
        "x": 3700,
        "y": 1300,
        "text": "GAP 3: W-bend over the gap: a glide passes through the edge of its pull: steer through, or get caught and throw out to T4"
      },
      { "x": 3700, "y": 2200, "text": "thorns under gap 3 (the floor only)" },
      {
        "x": 4700,
        "y": 1700,
        "text": "T4: a forgiving landing (the beetle's patrol starts 380 past the lip); W6 over the beetle at the chasm's edge"
      },
      {
        "x": 5400,
        "y": 1500,
        "text": "THE LAMP CHAIN over the chasm to the oak's door: a root lip at T4's edge (hop it: no walk-off), into C1, throw right, wings, caught by C2, throw up-right, T5"
      },
      {
        "x": 5600,
        "y": 2180,
        "text": "THE DARK WAY (Tatter's): the chasm's floor, in view from T4's lip: a miss lands here; walk east, a root step up onto T5 (slow, safe)"
      },
      {
        "x": 7300,
        "y": 1700,
        "text": "T5 at the oak's west door; a bark floor panel opens a pocket with W-pocket"
      },
      {
        "x": 7000,
        "y": 140,
        "text": "RETURN BOUGH (wall jump): kick up T-ret's east face, walk west, drop onto E0"
      },
      { "x": 2600, "y": 200, "text": "LANDMARK: the long bough overhead; ahead, the oak's door" }
